2020-09-03, Version 5.12.0
_ varnish plugin: Added varnish 6 support. Thanks to Charly Koza, Ismael
Puerto. #3445
_ amqp1 plugin: New options to limit send queue length has been added.
Thanks to Ryan McCabe. #3432
